{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d9f01a99a11d0986cf982fde500d7382","RawContent":"I CHOSE &#039;&#039;DAUGHTER&#039;&#039; BY Loudon Wainwright . I fell in love with this song. it&#039;s at the end of the movie knocked up. Here are the lyrics.\n \n \n Everything she sees\n she says she wants.\n Everything she wants\n I see she gets.\n \n That&#039;s my daughter in the water\n everything she owns I bought her\n Everything she owns.\n That&#039;s my daughter in the water,\n everything she knows I taught her.\n Everything she knows.\n \n Everything I say\n she takes to heart.\n Everything she takes\n she takes apart.\n \n That&#039;s my daughter in the water\n every time she fell I caught her.\n Every time she fell.\n That&#039;s my daughter in the water,\n I lost every time I fought her.\n Find More lyrics at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.sweetslyrics.com\"&gt;SWEETS LYRICS&lt;\/a&gt;\n I lost every time.\n \n Every time she blinks\n she strikes somebody blind.\n Everything she thinks\n blows her tiny mind.\n That&#039;s my daughter in the water,\n who&#039;d have ever thought her?\n Who&#039;d have ever thought?\n That&#039;s my daughter in the water,\n I lost everytime I fought her\n Yea, I lost every time.","Attachments":[],"Id":596467,"PostDate":1234977956,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I CHOSE ''DAUGHTER'' BY Loudon Wainwright . I fell in love with this song. it's at the end of the movie knocked up. Here are the lyrics.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Everything she sees<br \/> she says she wants.<br \/> Everything she wants<br \/> I see she gets.<br \/> <br \/> That's my daughter in the water<br \/> everything she owns I bought her<br \/> Everything she owns.<br \/> That's my daughter in the water,<br \/> everything she knows I taught her.<br \/> Everything she knows.<br \/> <br \/> Everything I say<br \/> she takes to heart.<br \/> Everything she takes<br \/> she takes apart.<br \/> <br \/> That's my daughter in the water<br \/> every time she fell I caught her.<br \/> Every time she fell.<br \/> That's my daughter in the water,<br \/> I lost every time I fought her.<br \/> Find More lyrics at <a href='http:\/\/www.sweetslyrics.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>SWEETS LYRICS<\/a><br \/> I lost every time.<br \/> <br \/> Every time she blinks<br \/> she strikes somebody blind.<br \/> Everything she thinks<br \/> blows her tiny mind.<br \/> That's my daughter in the water,<br \/> who'd have ever thought her?<br \/> Who'd have ever thought?<br \/> That's my daughter in the water,<br \/> I lost everytime I fought her<br \/> Yea, I lost every time.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/107\/224\/20090720\/We+get+Married%21%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/107\/2...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"smilesnj17@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1234054997,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214720.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LAURENANDBILL","Id":214720,"Name":"LAURENANDBILL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"44e251f8c923d1eb33bedf60b04f3002","RawContent":"Hi!\n \n This is something that is very important to me to! I LOVE the dances with Dad and the first dances at weddings... so for mine it will be a BIG decision. I am NOT a fan of country music, but I think that the most important thing is that it means something to you and your dad. \n \n The Billy Joel Lyrics are pretty good though!","Attachments":[],"Id":596472,"PostDate":1234978361,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi!<br \/> <br \/> This is something that is very important to me to! I LOVE the dances with Dad and the first dances at weddings... so for mine it will be a BIG decision. I am NOT a fan of country music, but I think that the most important thing is that it means something to you and your dad. <br \/> <br \/> The Billy Joel Lyrics are pretty good though!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>JENNA + ROB SITTING IN A TREE... K-I-S-S-I-N-G!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jennacalder@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1234894318,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214999.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":50,"PhotoHeight":50,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jac76","Id":214999,"Name":"jac76","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7c980fe0fe2e006c5b15b4832f873d3","RawContent":"Mummergirl - I just wanted to let you know my dad did the EXACT same thing to me. I&#039;m not a fan of country but he wants Heartland&#039;s I loved her First and every time I hear it, I cry and I don&#039;t want to be sobbing the whole dance. But I&#039;m gonna suck it up too - I&#039;m thinking of trying to listen to the song every day to try and build up a tear tolerance! : )","Attachments":[],"Id":596493,"PostDate":1234979204,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Mummergirl - I just wanted to let you know my dad did the EXACT same thing to me. I'm not a fan of country but he wants Heartland's I loved her First and every time I hear it, I cry and I don't want to be sobbing the whole dance. But I'm gonna suck it up too - I'm thinking of trying to listen to the song every day to try and build up a tear tolerance! : )\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><d