 I will use yet.","Attachments":[],"Id":596504,"PostDate":1234979705,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>LAURENANDBILL<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I CHOSE ''DAUGHTER'' BY Loudon Wainwright . I fell in love with this song. it's at the end of the movie knocked up. .<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> I love that song also!!! Not sure what my dad and I will use yet.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erika.holler@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.177.241.195","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1224462180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212330.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":79,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Erika J","Id":212330,"Name":"Erika J","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"706628812652811c75248d6eb8366f5a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Beautiful choices ladies!! I&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1341915,"PostDate":1289994350,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Beautiful choices ladies!! I<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hcobaron@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277499840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229570.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"horegan","Id":229570,"Name":"horegan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21f30f849ea406db4b63bc6280392459","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow, I&#039;ve got some listening to do. Thanks all for sharing your ideas.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1342440,"PostDate":1290028683,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow, I've got some listening to do. Thanks all for sharing your ideas.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sonyajoy@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1276183077,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229060.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sonyaj","Id":229060,"Name":"sonyaj","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"709f8717c9cea022792977a5a11e6bb5","RawContent":"I am definitely going with Somewhere Over the Rainbow too, but not sure if we will dance to the original or the Iz version.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]seaprincess[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n I choose \"Somewhere over the rainbow\" by Iz for my father\/daughter dance. It means something to us, so it was perfect[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1342696,"PostDate":1290064270,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am definitely going with Somewhere Over the Rainbow too, but not sure if we will dance to the original or the Iz version.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>seaprincess<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I choose \"Somewhere over the rainbow\" by Iz for my father\/daughter dance. It means something to us, so it was perfect<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandastreet5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1279795004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230532.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Amanda+Dave","Id":230532,"Name":"Amanda+Dave","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":31164,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1952a5cfe09c30c7f733c46ae1a1cac","RawContent":"I am definitely going with Somewhere Over the Rainbow too, but not sure if we will dance to the original or the Iz version.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]seaprincess[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n I choose \"Somewhere over the rainbow\" by Iz for my father\/daughter dance. It means something to us, so it was perfect[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1342698,"PostDate":1290064432,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am definitely going with Somewhere Over the Rainbow too, but not sure if we will dance to the original or the Iz version.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <