Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I went with the Ike route \"Somewhere over the rainbow\" and loved how it made me feel walking down the isle... Soooo island-y... I was sooo giddy... LOL\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>AmandaNovember 8, 2008<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t31327\">My Planning Thread<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t32668\">Pro Pics<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t30363\">Lynns Little Creations Topper<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"im2cute4u411@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212412921,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209708.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"2bebridejamaica","Id":209708,"Name":"2bebridejamaica","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8bb9c3c1042b6583dff2f7cbdd7d9d69","RawContent":"my date is still a long time away but I have been thinking about songs as well. I am going to have the steel drum band, I want them to play some where over the rainbow while guests and FI get into place and then Cannon D when I walk down the aisle. I am also dancing my first dance after the ceremony on the beach to wise men (cant help