{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":107,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":12229,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1662519,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":260291,"Name":"jimsput00","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1347463205,"LastPoster":{"Id":285354,"Name":"nydvknight","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1662519,"PostDate":1347463205,"PostContent":"I have heard good comments about this company for a destination wedding photographer. \u00a0Has anybo...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsmrtic@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347463024,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jimsput00","Id":260291,"Name":"jimsput00","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d14c4abc8746da2c138ab5d817c943c0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have heard good comments about this company for a destination wedding photographer. &amp;nbsp;Has anybody had any experience using them?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1662519,"PostDate":1347463205,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have heard good comments about this company for a destination wedding photographer. \u00a0Has anybody had any experience using them?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsmrtic@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347463024,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260291.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jimsput00","Id":260291,"Name":"jimsput00","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48f25983ad65c9e0f3b0ef8a9aee4f66","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My husband and I worked with this company during our summer wedding (in June). &amp;nbsp;They are &lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AMAZING&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;! &amp;nbsp;As we were planning from afar, we spent a lot of time researching various companies and read nothing but wonderful reviews about HDC, so we just went for it. &amp;nbsp;Arnaud was very prompt, professional and &lt;strong&gt;TRUSTWORTHY &lt;\/strong&gt;(this was a huge deal as we were dealing with expenses with a company from another country!) . &amp;nbsp;We met with him a few days before the wedding and had the pleasure to work with him during our ceremony. &amp;nbsp;Our other photographer was Charlie and he was just as fantastic. &amp;nbsp;They were both very easy going, flexible kept me calm before the ceremony, captured all of the moments we wanted to remember forever, were flexible, maintained professionalism throughout our wedding and engaged with our guests. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We could not believe how quickly the images were available for us to view and they were printed for us the day before we left to go home! &amp;nbsp;Our photo book came exactly when Arnaud stated, and it is beautiful! &amp;nbsp; We chose the diamond package and were astounded by all of the services and pictures were received for the price and the prompt timing! &amp;nbsp; If you want memorable, gorgeous photos for your wedding and not stress about it from afar, I would HIGHLY recommend HDC Photography. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1663661,"PostDate":1347832618,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My husband and I worked with this company during our summer wedding (in June). \u00a0They are <em><strong>AMAZING<\/strong><\/em>! \u00a0As we were planning from afar, we spent a lot of time researching various companies and read nothing but wonderful reviews about HDC, so we just went for it. \u00a0Arnaud was very prompt, professional and <strong>TRUSTWORTHY <\/strong>(this was a huge deal as we were dealing with expenses with a company from another country!) . \u00a0We met with him a few days before the wedding and had the pleasure to work with him during our ceremony. \u00a0Our other photographer was Charlie and he was just as fantastic. \u00a0They were both very easy going, flexible kept me calm before the ceremony, captured all of the moments we wanted to remember forever, were flexible, maintained professionalism throughout our wedding and engaged with our guests. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We could not believe how quickly the images were available for us to view and they were printed for us the day before we left to go home! \u00a0Our photo book came exactly when Arnaud stated, and it is beautiful! \u00a0 We chose the diamond package and were astounded by all of the services and pictures were received for the price and the prompt timing! \u00a0 If you want memorable, gorgeous photos for your wedding and not stress about it from afar, I would HIGHLY recommend HDC Photography. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jimdollywedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1313775006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244149.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"djmags15","Id":244149,"Name":"djmags15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69414,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ce1d141a13baf3daf4494bea12e10ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;You can find here on BDW a lot of great reviews of HDC ;)&amp;nbsp;\n \n On this site:&amp;nbsp;\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/photographer\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/category\/photographer&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;\n \n P.S :\n Just fell free to look also our site:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.caribbeanemotions.com\"&gt;www.caribbeanemotions.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 15.454545021057129px; \"&gt;We have a couple of free Dates for the next few Months .Our current Promotion for you its the Multimedia Package which included a professional Photographer and a professional Videographer for only 800$US ,or a the Royal Package which included a professional Photographer for only 500$US .So if you book one of these Package before October 31,2012 you can economize $ &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;300 U.S.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 15.454545021057129px; \"&gt;For more Informations please contact us.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.727272033691406px; line-height: 15.454545021057129px; \" \/&gt; &lt;br style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.727272033691406px; line-height: 15.454545021057129px; \" \/&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &#039;lucida grande&#039;, tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 15.454545021057129px; \"&gt;E-mail : info@caribbeanemotions.com&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1664018,"PostDate":1347913858,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n    