me info on pricing without sifting through 181 pages &lt;span alt=\":D\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362602403045_1095\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\"&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362602403045_1094\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Can anyone share the following?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;Number of Guests -&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;Meal Selection\/Guest - ie. the $35 option, $45 option etc &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;Amount of Appetizers- &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;Type of open Bar - ie. International\/National\/ &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;Fees paid for Decor and other services acquired from Jellyfish -&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\"&gt;TOTAL PAID TO JELLYFISH - &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I know the DJ portion could either be paid to Jellyfish or an outside DJ. And i know the Photog\/Video would be separate. I&#039;m trying to figure out how much would be left in the budget after Jellyfish gets their portion.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;THANKS! GREATLY APPRECIATED&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1730081,"PostDate":1362584995,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Lots of threads on this restaurant but I'm hoping to gather some info on pricing without sifting through 181 pages <span alt=\":D\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362602403045_1095\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1362602403045_1094\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> Can anyone share the following?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">Number of Guests -<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">Meal Selection\/Guest - ie. the $35 option, $45 option etc <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">Amount of Appetizers- <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">Type of open Bar - ie. International\/National\/ <\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">Fees paid for Decor and other services acquired from Jellyfish -<\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255)\">TOTAL PAID TO JELLYFISH - <\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I know the DJ portion could either be paid to Jellyfish or an outside DJ. And i know the Photog\/Video would be separate. I'm trying to figure out how much would be left in the budget after Jellyfish gets their portion.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>THANKS! GREATLY APPRECIATED<\/strong><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"asha_sips@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362144436,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266756.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":239,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Asha","Id":266756,"Name":"Asha","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAd