{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":133,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1908525,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285647,"Name":"josenjacks","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1450685034,"LastPoster":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1908525,"PostDate":1450685034,"PostContent":"\u00a0 What do you think is the most unique wedding you've ever been to?\n\n My boyfriend told me last...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"josenjacks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.178.154.190","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1450684802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"josenjacks","Id":285647,"Name":"josenjacks","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.178.154.190","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79802,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83d39b0bab70c953366e7d1c1be32bc9","RawContent":"&amp;nbsp;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;What do you think is the most unique wedding you&#039;ve ever been to?\n\n\nMy boyfriend told me last night that he knows when he&#039;s going to propose to me and I can&#039;t help getting excited (even though I know that&#039;s silly as he hasn&#039;t even asked me yet!) and thinking that if we do get married I&#039;d like something really intimate, unique and special and would love to hear your stories.\n\n\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;   &lt;\/span&gt;_____________&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/weddingsspirit.com\/top-10-amazing-beach-wedding-ideas\/\"]unique wedding[\/url]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src=\"[url=\"https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/CSwYKP2UEAELH2N.jpg\"]https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/CSwYKP2UEAELH2N.jpg\"[\/url] alt=\"CSwYKP2UEAELH2N.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908525,"PostDate":1450685034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                \t\u00a0<div><span>What do you think is the most unique wedding you've ever been to?<br><br>My boyfriend told me last night that he knows when he's going to propose to me and I can't help getting excited (even though I know that's silly as he hasn't even asked me yet!) and thinking that if we do get married I'd like something really intimate, unique and special and would love to hear your stories.<br><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span>_____________<\/div><div><a href='http:\/\/weddingsspirit.com\/top-10-amazing-beach-wedding-ideas\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>unique wedding<\/a><\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div><div><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/CSwYKP2UEAELH2N.jpg\" alt=\"CSwYKP2UEAELH2N.jpg\"><\/span><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"josenjacks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.178.154.190","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1450684802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"josenjacks","Id":285647,"Name":"josenjacks","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79802,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"937afec97c65d43688eb530d6c943609","RawContent":"[quote name=\"josenjacks\" post=\"1908525\" timestamp=\"1450703034\"]\n\nWhat do you think is the most unique wedding you&#039;ve ever been to?\n\nMy boyfriend told me last night that he knows when he&#039;s going to propose to me and I can&#039;t help getting excited (even though I know that&#039;s silly as he hasn&#039;t even asked me yet!) and thinking that if we do get married I&#039;d like something really intimate, unique and special and would love to hear your stories.\n\n      _____________\n[url=\"http:\/\/weddingsspirit.com\/top-10-amazing-beach-wedding-ideas\/\"]unique wedding[\/url]\n\n\n[img]https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/CSwYKP2UEAELH2N.jpg[\/img]\n[\/quote]@[member=\"josenjacks\"] Do share with us your story on how he proposed when it happens! Here is what I have seen recently, this year and I\u00b4m doing it again next March.   2 grooms contacted me needing help planning a surprised wedding the one this year was a proposal turned into an intimate wedding ceremony followed by an intimate dinner.\n\nThe one next year, the groom is letting the bride know the morning off.  That they are getting married and she needs to get ready, and he is even buying the wedding dress without her knowing.\n\nI guess as a wedding planner, I do get to see all kinds of wedding , big or intimate!\n\n\nHappy Future Planning :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1908538,"PostDate":1450692953,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>josenjacks, on 21 December 2015 - 08:03 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>What do you think is the most unique wedding you've ever been to?<br><br>\nMy boyfriend told me last night that he knows when he's going to propose to me and I can't help getting excited (even though I know that's silly as he hasn't even asked me yet!) and thinking that if we do get married I'd like something really intimate, unique and special and would love to hear your stories.<br><br>\n\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0_____________<\/div>\n<div><a href='http:\/\/weddingsspirit.com\/top-10-amazing-beach-wedding-ideas\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>unique wedding<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/media\/CSwYKP2UEAELH2N.jpg\" alt=\"CSwYKP2UEAELH2N.jpg\"><\/span><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285647\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285647-josenjacks\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">josenjacks<\/span><\/a> Do share with us your story on how he proposed when it happens! Here is what I have seen recently, this year and I\u00b4m doing it again next March. \u00a0 2 grooms contacted me needing help planning a surprised wedding the one this year was a proposal turned into an intimate wedding ceremony followed by an intimate dinner.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The one next year, the groom is letting the bride know the morning off. \u00a0That they are getting married and she needs to get ready, and he is even buying the wedding dress without her knowing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I guess as a wedding planner, I do get to see all kinds of wedding , big or intimate!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Future Planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.142.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79802,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8898381b5836abf5aad4a647f75c781a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community josenjacks - you&#039;ve come to the right place for loads of interesting ideas, info, advice and support from all of us here - so well done on getting a great start even before his proposal!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Each wedding couple has their very own unique style and preferences, so as wedding photographers, we get to see a LOT of different formats and celebrations (one of our perks! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We recently attended a local wedding photographer&#039;s wedding.....and it was fascinating to see what they chose for their own special Big Day....as they get to see so many!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s an album showing their unique images......enjoy :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;From our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153669053489487.1073741948.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Unico Beach Club, Puerto Morelas Wedding Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/12095198_10153669061164487_6831221306618813539_o.jpg\" alt=\"12095198_10153669061164487_6831221306618\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/12140007_10153669058209487_775750675978656758_o.jpg\" alt=\"12140007_10153669058209487_7757506759786\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/12109967_10153669072774487_751064714570293443_o.jpg\" alt=\"12109967_10153669072774487_7510647145702\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/12141176_10153669081094487_2222788344614167828_o.jpg\" alt=\"12141176_10153669081094487_2222788344614\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/12120197_10153669090624487_5621411151873000568_o.jpg\" alt=\"12120197_10153669090624487_5621411151873\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/12095000_10153669084144487_9206062771768155510_o.jpg\" alt=\"12095000_10153669084144487_9206062771768\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope you find the perfect unique venue and format for your plans when the time is right!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Meanwhile, wishing you and yours a Very Merry Christmas and the most Amazing New Year ahead - ENJOY!!! cheers, team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/10887520_10152928701404487_3240177822190211982_o.jpg\" alt=\"10887520_10152928701404487_3240177822190\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908550,"PostDate":1450701842,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community josenjacks - you've come to the right place for loads of interesting ideas, info, advice and support from all of us here - so well done on getting a great start even before his proposal!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Each wedding couple has their very own unique style and preferences, so as wedding photographers, we get to see a LOT of different formats and celebrations (one of our perks! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We recently attended a local wedding photographer's wedding.....and it was fascinating to see what they chose for their own special Big Day....as they get to see so many!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's an album showing their unique images......enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>From our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153669053489487.1073741948.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Unico Beach Club, Puerto Morelas Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/12095198_10153669061164487_6831221306618813539_o.jpg\" alt=\"12095198_10153669061164487_6831221306618\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/12140007_10153669058209487_775750675978656758_o.jpg\" alt=\"12140007_10153669058209487_7757506759786\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/12109967_10153669072774487_751064714570293443_o.jpg\" alt=\"12109967_10153669072774487_7510647145702\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpt1\/t31.0-8\/12141176_10153669081094487_2222788344614167828_o.jpg\" alt=\"12141176_10153669081094487_2222788344614\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/12120197_10153669090624487_5621411151873000568_o.jpg\" alt=\"12120197_10153669090624487_5621411151873\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/12095000_10153669084144487_9206062771768155510_o.jpg\" alt=\"12095000_10153669084144487_9206062771768\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you find the perfect unique venue and format for your plans when the time is right!!!<\/p>\n<p>Meanwhile, wishing you and yours a Very Merry Christmas and the most Amazing New Year ahead - ENJOY!!! cheers, team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-sea1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/10887520_10152928701404487_3240177822190211982_o.jpg\" alt=\"10887520_10152928701404487_3240177822190\"><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79802","Title":"The Most Unique Wedding?","LastPostDate":1450701842},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
